OL,3,AMan jailed for life over failed knife
OL,4,Aattack at Israeli embassy in London
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who tried to break into the
OL,7,FIsraeli embassy in London to carry out
OL,8,Fa knife attack has been jailed for life
OL,9,Fwith a minimum term of 20 years.
OL,11,FAbdullah Albadri was carrying two
OL,12,Fknives when he attempted to get inside
OL,13,Fthe embassy in Kensington on 28 April
OL,14,F2025, before being detained by armed
OL,15,Fpolice.
OL,17,FThe 34-year-old from Kuwait had arrived
OL,18,Fin the UK on a small boat 16 days
OL,19,Fearlier.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
